	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Emoji Search Workflow

Type "emoji" followed by a search term to find emoji by shortcode or description.

Examples:
- emoji heart
- emoji thumbs
- emoji smile
- emoji version (show version and links)

Select an emoji to copy it to your clipboard.

Frequently used emoji appear when you open the search with no query.</string>
